 "verdict": "REFUTED, AND BY THE RECORDER RATHER THAN BY THE CHAIN. Every one of the 1,424 transactions with an execution replays in all six windows (0 divergent, 0 refused), so window one is not the worst of the six on the with-execution denominator and `era` is not the dominant variable for codetracer-evm-recorder d411e3a: no variable is, because nothing fails. The premise the expectation was read from was real: under the header-field ladder it named, block 4,370,100 replayed under BERLIN and 58 of its 59 traced transactions disagreed with their receipts on gas (recorded in spec_for_block's doc comment). That was a trial, not a reading, and spec_for_block (0301bf3) now selects the revision by mainnet activation height, so the collapsed rung no longer exists. The remaining divergence in the 0301bf3 reading (27 rows) was the recorder too: 14 logs kept from reverted frames and 13 gas differences from typed-transaction fields the replay did not carry, both fixed in d411e3a. Over ALL transactions window one is lowest (34.1%), because 209 of its 317 are plain value transfers that execute no code; that is transaction mix, which the no-code-executed exclusion names, not era."
}
